  "description": "Easy On, easy off unisex compact bicycle with 24x1.75 wheels, SINGLE SPEED coaster brake\n\nAdults looking to enjoy riding a bicycle again should consider the Worksman MG Unisex Comfort Bicycle. This compact bicycle features 24\"\"x1.75 wheels for a smooth ride and a easy step through frame. With the Compact design, getting on and off the bicycle is easier than most and it is a bit closer to the ground, making it safer as a riders feet can more easily touch the ground when stopping. The Unsiex comfort Bike has an upright handlebar and padded seat for good ergonomic posture. Standard Mudguards protect you from splashes and look great. The bike features a reliable coaster (foot) brake and is available in single or three speed versions. Riding with confidence and comfort (Bike shown with optional 7917T-1 Backrest and 4919 rear rack)). Recommended for riders from 5'0\" to 6.2\" range and up to 250 pounds. We do offer an industrial heavy duty version as well for heftier riders (call 800 962 2453 and ask about the Unisex MG-R Bikes) Perfect bike for those who desire comfort and a safe feel with a subtle pedal forward design.",
